### Título vazio → 400 com details
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "  " }

### Sem corpo → 400
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks


### Título com tipo errado → 400

POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": 123 }


### JSON quebrado → 400

POST  http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": }

### Criar (rode duas vezes: a segunda deve dar 409)

POST  http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Estudar Zod" }

### PATCH vazio → 400

PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Id inválido → 400

GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/abc

### Filtro inválido → 400

GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?done=talvez

### Filtro válido → 200

GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?done=true

### Rota inexistente → 404 em JSON

GET http://localhost:3000/xyz

### Listar

GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### Buscar uma

GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/1

### Marcar como concluída

PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }

### Remover

DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/1
